-      (∀ γ : ℝ, 1 ≤ γ → γ ≤ slabGamma0 d →
-        eLpNorm g (ENNReal.ofReal γ) (slabBase d T) ≤
-          (slabConstant' d Cocc Cdec cdec γ : ℝ≥0∞) * μ univ *
